msgid "Connect an EdgeTX radio over USB (Model setup → USB Joystick: Advanced, Joystick). It flies while connected; the engine starts once the throttle stick has been low. Unplugging it pauses the flight with the engine at idle. K calibrates it. Assign gear AUX or the optional Toggle landing gear action in Controller settings."
